  "notes": "Geometry enters only through the NURBS description; the native meshes contribute cell-centroid positions alone, as query points and as volume anchor positions. Every native cell is decoded directly, so every mapping is the identity with coverage 1.0 and no interpolation, nearest-neighbour assignment or extrapolation is applied. Volume queries are decoded in chunks of 2000000, the last chunk of each case holding the remainder, and all surface queries of a case fit in its first chunk. Each chunk is decoded against the same geometry and anchor context, recomputed from identical inputs, and query points are never attention keys, so chunking does not change the result."
